kground-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_q_root.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"QuestionnaireRoot\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> PHQPANIK</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Die vier Ja/Nein-Screeningfragen zu Angst- und Panikattacken des Patient Health Questionnaire (PHQ, Block 3a–3d; Spitzer, Kroenke &amp; Williams 1999), deutsche Fassung PHQ-D (Löwe et al. 2002), 4-Wochen-Recall. Englisch primär, Deutsch als `translation`. linkIds im PHQ-D-Block-Namespace (`phq-phq3a`–`phq-phq3d`), Dictionary-Variablen `phq3a`–`phq3d` in `item.code`. Sprungregel des Formulars als `enableWhen` (3b–3d nur bei 3a = ja). Kein Score-Item: Der PHQ-Algorithmus für das Paniksyndrom braucht zusätzlich die hier nicht erhobene Symptomliste 4a–4k. In PCOR-MII gepflegt, weil das MII-PRO-Modul kein Artefakt dafür führt (ADR-012).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Questionnaire</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">https://bih-cei.github.io/PCOR-MII/Questionnaire/PHQPANIK#0.9.0</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.phq-panik-intro\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">PHQPANIK / </span>phq-panik-intro</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Questions about anxiety.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.phq-phq3a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">PHQPANIK / </span>phq-phq3a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">a. In the last 4 weeks, have you had an anxiety attack — suddenly feeling fear or panic?</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Optionen: <a href=\"#opt-item.phq-phq3a\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.phq-phq3b\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span s